{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.poster.avif?t=1769689980\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.webm?t=1769689980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking from a nightmare, Sophie finds herself in an ever-changing dorm, with no memory of how she ended up there, while a mysterious entity tries to corrupt her mind and manipulate her identity. Can you lead Sophie out with her sanity intact?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative:</strong> A deep narrative that unfolds through environmental storytelling across multiple playthroughs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Gameplay:</strong> Face mind-bending trials where observation, choice, and caution determine your fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Terror:</strong> Unpredictable events and multiple endings keep every playthrough tense. Will this be the one where you finally escape?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Burn Psychological Dread:</strong> No cheap jumpscares - only dread, mystery, and mind-bending unease that lingers long after the screen fades to black.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.poster.avif?t=1769689980\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.webm?t=1769689980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Cerebral is an experimental psychological horror with unconventional puzzles. Not for traditional horror fans. If you enjoy strange, abstract, and unsettling experiences, this game was made for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like it, please consider leaving a Steam review, it helps a lot.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Child's Play","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/57bc0bc1d6dc7aaed3882385284cab286fc21dd8.jpg"},{"name":"ENDurance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/d1914afd46a9982a6f959743bd940fe895ef9f32.jpg"},{"name":"Radical Entity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/e94ac3b97ae95ec48500681f91baf7e0970cb07c.jpg"},{"name":"No Rescue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/33140aeaab3aaf5f5db9244b00c92d3ad223fca1.jpg"},{"name":"Surrender Your Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/daad04b5ae574c56066ecaf3715e797031c2f987.jpg"},{"name":"What I\u2019ve Become?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/ce15fc8a14beac11e65840553ca0a5c181ff44da.jpg"},{"name":"CTR Activated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/d16e22bb300c2386e5464138f2cd4268b5ef0b27.jpg"},{"name":"One and a Half Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/1488159ef40b3ecb40e17bf9ad3f3f3fdfbb7582.jpg"},{"name":"One Full Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2204820/fc63c327db66bfd68d9641cdf69935e14aa4af7f.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2204820?t=1769689980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/06515b55ab81c56a03848e6c06332c1c57b1f32d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769689980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/14fdf19292e92d3cb5b86b612f100396cdd95ae7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769689980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/14fdf19292e92d3cb5b86b612f100396cdd95ae7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769689980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.poster.avif?t=1769689980\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/7ad0621bbfd203f45fc412818cb2bc79.webm?t=1769689980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking from a nightmare, Sophie finds herself in an ever-changing dorm, with no memory of how she ended up there, while a mysterious entity tries to corrupt her mind and manipulate her identity. Can you lead Sophie out with her sanity intact?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Narrative:</strong> A deep narrative that unfolds through environmental storytelling across multiple playthroughs.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twisted Gameplay:</strong> Face mind-bending trials where observation, choice, and caution determine your fate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable Terror:</strong> Unpredictable events and multiple endings keep every playthrough tense. Will this be the one where you finally escape?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow-Burn Psychological Dread:</strong> No cheap jumpscares - only dread, mystery, and mind-bending unease that lingers long after the screen fades to black.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.poster.avif?t=1769689980\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/extras/ccbbdcb28396a35db5ceb6212f4c49cb.webm?t=1769689980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> Cerebral is an experimental psychological horror with unconventional puzzles. Not for traditional horror fans. If you enjoy strange, abstract, and unsettling experiences, this game was made for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like it, please consider leaving a Steam review, it helps a lot.</p>","developers":["Youviverse"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204820/2bde4564764b633ee1f65c322a446023c04f14fa/header.jpg?t=1769689980","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Cerebral 